<mxCell id="note1" value="Informational (commented) BIGINT columns — never a real FK, per POS_SPECS.md's own optional-module posture — are NOT drawn as edges here: pos_terminals/pos_txn_hdrs.default_price_list_id/price_list_id (SALES.price_lists.id, informational since Sales is plan-optional relative to POS), pos_txn_hdrs/pos_loyalty_accounts/pos_store_credits.customer_id (CRM.partners.id, informational since CRM is plan-optional), pos_sessions.cashier_employee_id (HCM.employees.id, informational — see POS_SPECS.md §3C/§7 open item), pos_txn_hdrs.sales_order_subject_id (SALES.so_hdrs.id, informational, set once SalesOrderService responds, §3J). Real FKs shown: users (Laravel core) and INVENTORY.products/warehouses/stock_batches/stock_serials (Inventory is on every plan today). pos_promotion_rules/pos_txn_line_modifiers.price_delta and pos_txn_lines' own resolved price/tax are snapshots at time of sale, never re-resolved (§3S/§3N) — CHECK constraints restricting enum-like columns to the fixed value sets in POS_SPECS.md §3/§4 are not modeled as separate cells." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;align=left;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="420" width="2460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
